msgid "Some variants differ only by case and spaces; some have a prefix; some are in Cyrillic. Clean what string methods can clean. Then a **dictionary** ([session 6](./06-dictionaries.md#_5-lookup-tables-and-nomenclatures)) maps the Cyrillic names:"
