#. heading 3
#: site/lectures/07-text-and-regex.md:702
msgid "What a regular expression is"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/07-text-and-regex.md:704
msgid "The string methods look for **one** exact text: `\"EUR\" in s`. A **regular expression** (*regex*) describes a **set** of texts by their shape: \"a date like 30.09.2026\" covers every date in that format."
msgstr ""

