msgid "Bulgaria has an official transliteration (the Transliteration Act of 2009): `ж` -> `zh`, `ц` -> `ts`, `ч` -> `ch`, `ш` -> `sh`, `щ` -> `sht`, `ъ` -> `a`, `ю` -> `yu`, `я` -> `ya`, ... A dictionary of single letters to strings, used with `translate`:"
